This demo shows a way to parse Fortran command line arguments using NAMELIST.

Check out "Exploring NAMELIST" by John S. Urban [1] for the inspiration.
This sample hides all of the string processing details within
get_command_arguments().

[1] Exploring_NAMELIST.pdf, archived 2011-11-25 from
    http://home.comcast.net/~urbanjost/CLONE/KRACKEN/namelist/index.html
